    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "メジロドーベル",
            "enName": "Mejiro Dober",
            "jpText": "フクキタル。おた――",
            "enText": "Fukukitaru, hap—",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 7018535652827427631,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "みゃあああっ！！　それ以上はご勘弁をっ！！",
            "enText": "Myahhh!! Say no more!!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 6652418866639082048,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サイレンススズカ",
            "enName": "Silence Suzuka",
            "jpText": "え……？　どうしたの、フクキタル？\r\n私たちただ、あなたにお祝いを――",
            "enText": "Huh? What's the matter, Fukukitaru? \nWe just wanted to wish you a ——",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -2568044757702186415,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "でででですからご勘弁をぉ～！！\r\nすみません……もう、これ以上はっ……！！",
            "enText": "P-P-Please, no more! Sorry, but… I really \nmust ask you to stop!!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -7376152688203900341,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "その、今日が……幸せすぎてしまって。\r\nそのうえお2人にまでお祝いいただいたら……\nそんな幸福、味わってしまったら――！",
            "enText": "You see, today's… just been such a happy \nday, and if you two were to wish me a happy \nbirthday on top of that… that amount \nof happiness, i-it would…",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -3127790321894051895,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "運の反動が来た場合っ！　例えば明日、\r\nどんな不幸が待っているやら怖くてぇ～！",
            "enText": "It would trigger a reversal of fortune! \nWho knows what manner of calamities \nwould await me tomorrow!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -6335237864191209088,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロドーベル",
            "enName": "Mejiro Dober",
            "jpText": "……お誕生日おめでとう、フクキタル。",
            "enText": "…Happy birthday, Fukukitaru.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -6178913913053108273,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "ちょっとぉ！？",
            "enText": "Hey now!?",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 80090336797637110,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サイレンススズカ",
            "enName": "Silence Suzuka",
            "jpText": "おめでとう。……今日伝えたいんだもの、\r\n我慢してちょうだい。",
            "enText": "Happy birthday… We can't just ignore your \nspecial day, so you'll have to deal with it.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": -456108297887025363,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロドーベル",
            "enName": "Mejiro Dober",
            "jpText": "別に、不幸とやらが来たとしても……\r\n一緒に立ち向かうぐらい、してあげるよ。",
            "enText": "I mean, even if misfortune comes your way \nor whatever… we can just face it together, \ncan't we?",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 5136654700549144722,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "うぐ……お、お2人ともぉ～……！！",
            "enText": "<i>Hic</i>… Y-You guysss!!",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": -3829476028995587804,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "ありがとうございますっ！！\r\n今日の私は、ひたすらに、幸せ者ですっ！！",
            "enText": "Thank you! I'm as happy as can be today!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "pathId": -927990664109146698,
            "blockIdx": 12
        }
    ],
